    <mj-section background-color="#eff1f4" padding="1px 1px 1px 1px" border-radius="10px">
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
      padding="0"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.londonsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="Spy plot disrupted"
      href="https://www.londonsummary.com/"
    />
    <mj-text
      padding="20px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
        Spy plot disrupted
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text padding="0px 20px 0px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding-top: 15px; margin: 0;">
  <strong>What happened?</strong> Four men were arrested in London on <a href="https://www.cbsnews.com/news/london-iran-war-spies-arrested-jewish-community/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">suspicion of spying for Iran</a> as part of a counterterrorism investigation by the Metropolitan Police. Officers detained the suspects during early-morning raids at addresses in Barnet and Watford, on the northern outskirts of the capital. Police also arrested six additional people suspected of assisting the alleged activity, while another person was detained for assaulting an officer. The suspects, aged 55, 52, 40, and 22, remain under investigation.
</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding-top: 15px; margin: 0;">
  <strong>Why?</strong> Authorities believe the suspects were conducting surveillance on locations and individuals linked to London’s Jewish community on behalf of Iranian networks. UK and allied intelligence agencies fear Iran-linked networks are expanding covert operations in Europe. Police acted early to disrupt possible surveillance before it could escalate into intimidation, violence, or espionage.
</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; padding-top: 15px; padding-bottom: 20px; margin: 0;">
  <strong>Big picture: </strong>The case underscores growing concern in Europe about foreign state espionage and proxy operations. As a result, the UK increasingly sees an overlap between counterterrorism and counter-espionage, especially when hostile state activity targets communities within Western countries. In response, European governments are tightening security measures and strengthening intelligence coordination to detect and disrupt such threats earlier.
</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-spacer height="20px" />
