  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/media/2026/mar/06/axel-springer-buy-telegraph-daily-mail-owner" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">German media giant Axel Springer has agreed to acquire Telegraph Media Group, the owner of The Daily Telegraph, for £575M</a>. Axel Springer said the acquisition will help expand the brand internationally and strengthen its presence in English-language media, particularly in the US. The agreement ends a prolonged battle over ownership of the conservative-leaning British newspaper group.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
