  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/mar/06/royal-mail-criticised-raising-stamp-prices-failing-service" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Royal Mail has announced another increase in stamp prices, with first-class stamps rising by 10p to £1.80 and second-class stamps increasing by 4p to 91p</a> from April 7. The postal operator said the price hikes are needed to offset rising delivery costs and a sharp decline in letter volumes. However, consumer group Citizens Advice has criticised the move, arguing that customers are paying more for a service that continues to miss delivery targets.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>

